<title>UK: BayerVB sets 300 bln lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 300 bln lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Monte Dei Paschi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN ITL   COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    01.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.825   PAY DATE    01.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
